08:13.100 --> 08:17.350
"In the heavens, the sun and moon shine. 
You are like them in my thoughts,

08:13.100 --> 08:20.310
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

08:13.300 --> 08:20.310
<b>In the heavens</b>

08:14.560 --> 08:20.310
<b>The sun and moon shine</b>

08:15.680 --> 08:20.310
<b>You are like them in my thoughts</b>

08:17.350 --> 08:20.340
and I regret that with each 
new day, you grow older."

08:17.480 --> 08:20.310
<b>And I regret that with each new day</b>

08:18.810 --> 08:20.310
<b>You grow older</b>

08:21.530 --> 08:23.730
That's from the Man'yōshū, isn't it?

08:25.110 --> 08:29.620
I guess that means people from way back 
then wanted to be young again, too.

08:33.010 --> 08:34.980
Maybe I'll go buy a cake or something.

08:37.040 --> 08:39.030
Happy birthday!

08:39.030 --> 08:40.500
Happy birthday!

08:40.500 --> 08:42.500
Happy birthday!

