<i>Me?</i>

11:42.320 --> 11:44.060
It's Adashino.

11:44.410 --> 11:46.240
I came to see how you're doing.

11:48.060 --> 11:50.250
Are you there?

11:55.820 --> 11:57.570
It's unlocked.

11:57.940 --> 12:00.790
She's not the most security-minded, is she?

12:03.080 --> 12:07.580
We're here to search the premises! 
We're coming in and doing whatever we want!

12:10.540 --> 12:13.110
Damn it! Something smells good!

12:14.220 --> 12:17.890
I wish I could've come here 
