13:09.220 --> 13:11.880
Now I can write another novel!

13:15.770 --> 13:18.780
Being a child again isn't half bad!

13:19.310 --> 13:21.180
The ideas keep welling up!

13:21.650 --> 13:24.200
I just can't sit still!

13:27.500 --> 13:29.630
I'll head home and get writing!

13:33.250 --> 13:34.540
Head home...

13:37.090 --> 13:39.910
Where is home, again?

13:40.880 --> 13:42.120
Sumireko-san.

13:43.070 --> 13:45.310
It's dangerous for a child 
to be out walking alone.

13:47.330 --> 13:51.230
If you don't know the way home, 
I'll show you.

13:51.230 --> 13:53.940
Who are you?

13:53.940 --> 13:55.570
Now, that's just cruel.

13:55.570 --> 13:56.980
Have you forgotten?

13:56.980 --> 13:59.830
No. I remember every—

14:03.890 --> 14:05.740
My head hurts!

14:05.740 --> 14:08.020
It's a natural reaction to the form you're in.

14:09.900 --> 14:12.000
Did you think you'd grown young again?

14:12.830 --> 14:15.780
You've simply been forced into a child's body.

14:15.780 --> 14:19.570
The excess blood, muscle, and bone 
you had left over after shrinking

14:20.170 --> 14:23.960
are still within your body right now.

14:23.960 --> 14:25.730
How do you know this?

14:27.740 --> 14:30.770
You're Adashino-kun.

14:32.470 --> 14:36.520
This isn't right. Why aren't you 
surprised by how I look?

14:38.540 --> 14:41.670
Sumireko-san, you read 
this book, didn't you?

14:41.670 --> 14:43.280
That's...

14:43.650 --> 14:46.950
This is a cursed book that 
mustn't be read aloud.

14:46.950 --> 14:49.530
It's a Curiosity called a Juusho.

14:47.160 --> 14:49.530
<b>\h\hJuusho\h\h</b>

14:49.870 --> 14:53.040
You're saying I got smaller 
because I read a cursed book?

14:53.400 --> 14:56.930
You expect me to believe 
a ridiculous story like that?!

14:56.930 --> 15:01.050
It's no less ridiculous than the body you're 
in right now. Yet you don't believe me?

15:01.500 --> 15:04.550
