16:54.020 --> 16:57.460
Why did a book like that come to me at all?

16:57.460 --> 16:59.250
It was purely a coincidence.

16:59.580 --> 17:02.350
It wasn't as if you were specifically chosen.

17:02.670 --> 17:06.120
Are you telling me that it wasn't my fault?

17:06.120 --> 17:07.890
You're on the verge of death right now

17:07.890 --> 17:11.040
because of your thoughtless wandering, 
so that part is your fault.

17:15.600 --> 17:18.680
Am I really going to die?

17:19.130 --> 17:22.180
Moonlight is necessary 
for you to return to normal.

17:22.770 --> 17:25.190
Let's go someplace where we can see the moon.

17:26.440 --> 17:28.560
If we go now, we can still make it.

17:33.070 --> 17:35.150
We can see the moon from here.

17:35.150 --> 17:36.450
Let's give it a try.

17:38.370 --> 17:41.080
Should I just read the same poem again?

17:41.550 --> 17:44.270
What you initially read was a hanka.

17:44.890 --> 17:49.030
