chouka that it summarized.

17:49.610 --> 17:51.450
Here. Hurry.

17:51.450 --> 17:52.590
All right.

17:52.930 --> 18:06.270
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

17:52.930 --> 18:06.270
<b>I wish that the bridge to the heavens were longer</b>

17:53.000 --> 17:55.570
"I wish that the bridge to 
the heavens were longer.

17:55.350 --> 18:06.270
<b>I wish that the highest mountains were taller</b>

17:55.570 --> 17:58.100
I wish that the mountains were taller.

17:58.100 --> 18:02.460
I wish that Tsukuyomi's Water of Youth 
were something I could steal

17:58.340 --> 18:06.270
<b>I wish that Tsukuyomi's Water of Youth</b>

18:00.600 --> 18:06.270
<b>were something I could steal and give to you</b>

18:02.460 --> 18:05.160
and give to you to make you young again."

18:03.100 --> 18:06.270
<b>to make you young again</b>

18:22.660 --> 18:24.460
You seem to have reverted safely.

18:25.110 --> 18:28.130
This feels embarrassing for some reason.

18:28.460 --> 18:31.030
You're wearing panties under there, right?

18:31.030 --> 18:32.370
Of course I am.

18:32.880 --> 18:37.880
If you have any decency at all, could you 
lend me something to cover myself?

18:38.270 --> 18:40.820
Decency? Was that something I had?

18:42.850 --> 18:45.110
Please leave that book with me.

18:45.540 --> 18:47.690
I'll make sure it's disposed of properly.

18:48.560 --> 18:51.150
Will this towel suffice 
to hide that butt of yours?

18:51.460 --> 18:52.570
Huh?

18:52.570 --> 18:53.630
What?!

18:56.140 --> 18:57.060
Wait!

18:58.020 --> 18:59.160
Sumireko-san!

18:59.160 --> 19:01.570
Sorry, but I can't give this to you!

19:01.570 --> 19:03.420
I'll be sure to use it well!

19:03.420 --> 19:04.590
It's dangerous!

19:04.590 --> 19:05.470
Wha—

19:05.850 --> 19:07.170
You will give it to me!

19:07.170 --> 19:09.670
"In the heavens, the sun and moon shine. 
You are like them in my thoughts,

19:09.670 --> 19:11.930
and I regret that with each 
new day, you grow older!"

19:13.340 --> 19:14.170
Hey!

19:14.170 --> 19:17.820
Who is that guy? How did he get ahead of me?

19:19.680 --> 19:21.080
"I wish that the bridge to 
the heavens were longer!

19:21.080 --> 19:22.570
I wish that the mountains were taller!

19:22.570 --> 19:24.680
I wish that Tsukuyomi's Water of Youth 
were something I could steal

19:24.680 --> 19:27.690
and give to you to make you young again!"

19:28.940 --> 19:32.440
Why are you so good at using that? 
You, with your caterpillar eyebrows!

19:40.160 --> 19:41.330
Where am I?

19:45.860 --> 19:49.060
Now, please give me the book.

19:49.060 --> 19:50.340
No!

19:50.340 --> 19:52.090
I need this!

19:52.090 --> 19:55.590
If I'm not young, no one will read my books!

19:55.590 --> 19:58.210
Why do you think that?

19:58.210 --> 20:03.060
Because I've come to realize 
that I have no talent!

20:04.210 --> 20:06.350
All I keep getting are rejections.

20:06.370 --> 20:09.180
Talent? That gilding has long since worn away.

20:09.180 --> 20:13.610
All that's left is an immature person 
who can't socialize with others!

20:13.900 --> 20:16.610
But even so, I still want to write novels!

20:17.040 --> 20:20.620
I know better than anyone else 
that they're not any good.

20:20.620 --> 20:25.290
I write and I write, and then I'm told 
it's not good enough, so I revise it...

20:26.880 --> 20:30.400
But even so, I still want to write!

20:40.420 --> 20:42.150
Your nose is running.

20:44.700 --> 20:47.020
Don't worry. You can write.

20:47.410 --> 20:49.860
You've always had the courage within you.

20:50.290 --> 20:53.330
You're fine with running around 
town half-naked, after all.

20:54.520 --> 20:58.030
I am a fan of the author Ogawa Sumireko.

20:58.440 --> 21:01.460
Please let me read a new work of yours.

21:05.030 --> 21:07.210
"I wish that the bridge to 
the heavens were longer.

21:07.210 --> 21:09.300
I wish that the mountains were taller.

21:09.300 --> 21:12.490
I wish that Tsukuyomi's Water of Youth 
were something I could steal..."

21:13.040 --> 21:15.440
You don't play fair, Adashino-kun.

21:16.480 --> 21:19.050
If you insist like that, then I can't say no.

21:24.040 --> 21:27.650
I'm glad you're back, Sumireko-san.

21:31.890 --> 21:35.800
<i>If you'd like to report a found article, 
please come this way.</i>

21:38.570 --> 21:40.250
<i>A Juusho, is it?</i>

21:40.730 --> 21:46.080
<i>This can be exchanged for 
one ticket to Yami Station.</i>

21:46.590 --> 21:48.550
<i>I won't this time, thank you.</i>

21:49.490 --> 21:51.640
<i>That's a shame.</i>

21:53.810 --> 21:57.070
<i>We await the opportunity to serve you again.</i>

21:58.350 --> 22:00.210
<i>Mysterious disappearances...</i>

23:35.020 --> 23:40.870
<b>Schoolhouse, Drool, and an Apartment Wife</b>

23:36.240 --> 23:39.980
Next time: "Schoolhouse, Drool, 
and an Apartment Wife."
